OL,3,CCouncillor charged with posting
OL,4,C'grossly offensive comment' on social
OL,5,Cmedia
OL,7,FPolice have charged a Sunderland
OL,8,Fcouncillor with posting a grossly
OL,9,Foffensive comment on social media.
OL,11,FGlenn Gibbins, a Reform UK councillor
OL,12,Frepresenting the Hylton Castle ward,
OL,13,Fwas elected in May 2026.
OL,15,FHe has now been charged with an
OL,16,Foffence under the Communications Act
OL,17,F2003, Northumbria Police have said.
OL,19,FThe charge relates to a social media
OL,20,Fpost from 2024, which referenced the
OL,21,FNigerian community.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
