OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1785383018
OL,3,CCouncillor charged with posting
OL,4,C'grossly offensive comment' on social
OL,5,Cmedia
OL,7,FNorthumbria Police have told us they
OL,8,Freceived a report in relation to the
OL,9,Fpost in May this year and carried out
OL,10,Fan investigation.
OL,12,FAfter the force submitted a file to
OL,13,Fthe Crown Prosecution Service, the
OL,14,Fcharge was authorised.
OL,16,FThe 66-year-old, from the Sunderland
OL,17,Farea, is due to appear before South
OL,18,FTyneside Magistrates' Court in August.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/3
