OL,3,CCouncillor charged with posting
OL,4,C'grossly offensive comment' on social
OL,5,Cmedia
OL,7,FA spokesperson for Northumbria Police
OL,8,Fsaid: "We are aware there has already
OL,9,Fbeen significant interest in relation
OL,10,Fto this individual and the social
OL,11,Fmedia post.
OL,13,F"We would urge people not to speculate
OL,14,Fboth online and in the community in
OL,15,Frelation to this case."
